<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In Exodus we see, God’s desire being</l><l>For man to eat the Lamb.</l><l>As a creature so small, He’s approachable to all;</l><l>This Lamb is God Himself.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
